        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ches Crist, Chester A. Arthur, James A. Garfield\n- Roles: President of the United States, attorney, politician\n- Places: United States\n\nFacts:\n- Chester Alan Arthur was born on October 5, 1829, and died on November 18, 1886.\n- Chester Alan Arthur was an American attorney and politician.\n- Chester Alan Arthur served as the 21st President of the United States from 1881 to 1885.\n- Chester Alan Arthur succeeded James A. Garfield as President of the United States after Garfield's assassination.\n- Ches Crist was named for Chester A. Arthur, who was President of the United States at the time of Crist's birth.",
